Third-party model code
======================

`mlp.py` descends from MJRL's `mjrl/algos/mbrl/nn_dynamics.py` at commit
15bf3c0ed0c97fef761a8924d1b22413beb79900. It has been substantially modified
for CCIL. MJRL is licensed under Apache-2.0; see `LICENSE-mjrl.txt`.

`spectral_norm.py` descends from PyTorch's spectral-normalization utility and
has been modified to enforce an upper bound instead of unit normalization.
PyTorch is licensed under BSD-3-Clause; see `LICENSE-pytorch.txt`.
